sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User (Customer / Driver / Supplier / Admin)
    participant App as TANKR App (LoginScreen)
    participant AuthStore as Zustand authStore
    participant SupaAuth as Supabase Auth (SMS OTP)
    participant PGTrigger as Postgres Trigger (handle_new_user)
    participant Profiles as public.profiles Table
    participant Navigator as RootNavigator.tsx

    User->>App: Enters 10-digit mobile number (+91 XXXXXXXXXX)
    App->>AuthStore: sendOtp(rawPhoneDigits)
    AuthStore->>SupaAuth: signInWithOtp({ phone: '+91' + digits })
    SupaAuth-->>AuthStore: { error: null } (SMS dispatched / Test OTP ready)
    AuthStore-->>App: Navigate to VerifyOtpScreen

    User->>App: Enters 6-digit OTP code (e.g. 123456)
    App->>AuthStore: verifyOtp(token)
    AuthStore->>SupaAuth: verifyOtp({ phone, token, type: 'sms' })
    SupaAuth->>PGTrigger: Fires on_auth_user_created (if first-time user)
    PGTrigger->>Profiles: Inserts profile row with role & phone
    SupaAuth-->>AuthStore: { session, user }
    
    AuthStore->>Profiles: fetchProfile(user.id)
    Profiles-->>AuthStore: { full_name, role, is_onboarding_completed }
    AuthStore->>Navigator: State updated (session, profile)

    alt is_onboarding_completed == false
        Navigator-->>User: Render OnboardingScreen (Name & Delivery Address)
    else role == 'admin'
        Navigator-->>User: Render AdminDashboardScreen (10 Operations Desks)
    else role == 'supplier'
        Navigator-->>User: Render SupplierDashboardScreen (Fleet Manager)
    else role == 'driver'
        Navigator-->>User: Render DriverDashboardScreen (Telemetry & Orders)
    else role == 'customer'
        Navigator-->>User: Render AppTabs (Discovery, Tankers, Tracking)
    end
